### Login admin (nominal)
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@examhub.local", "password": "Admin123!" }

### Login mauvais mot de passe (401)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@examhub.local", "password": "faux" }

### Login compte desactive (403, RG-11)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "tiana@examhub.local", "password": "Etudiant123!" }

### Liste des etudiants (nominal)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### Liste des etudiants sans token (401)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/students

### Creation etudiant (nominal, 201)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Nouvel Etudiant", "email": "nouvel.etudiant@examhub.local", "password": "Etudiant123!" }

### Creation etudiant email deja pris (409)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Doublon", "email": "andry@examhub.local", "password": "Etudiant123!" }

### Modification etudiant (nominal)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/students/2
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Andry Modifie", "email": "andry@examhub.local" }

### Modification etudiant introuvable (404)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/students/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Personne", "email": "personne@examhub.local" }

### Reinitialisation mot de passe (nominal, 204)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/students/2/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "NouveauPass123!" }

### Reinitialisation mot de passe trop court (400)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/students/2/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "court" }

### Desactivation etudiant (nominal, RG-10 : is_active passe a false)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/students/2
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### Desactivation etudiant introuvable (404)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/students/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### Route admin appelee avec un token etudiant (403)
# @name loginEtudiant
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "miora@examhub.local", "password": "Etudiant123!" }

###
GET http://localhost:4000/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{loginEtudiant.response.body.token}}

# =====================================================================
#  Cours et examens — perimetre P3
# =====================================================================

### Liste des cours (nominal)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### Creation cours (nominal, 201) — le code est normalise en majuscules
POST http://localhost:4000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

{ "code": "algo1", "name": "Algorithmique", "description": "Structures et complexite." }

### Creation cours code deja pris (409)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

{ "code": "PROG2", "name": "Doublon" }

### Suppression cours qui porte des examens (409, RG-09)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/courses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### Creation examen fenetre inversee (400)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/exams
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

{ "courseId": 1, "title": "Fenetre inversee", "startsAt": "2026-09-10T10:00:00.000Z", "endsAt": "2026-09-10T08:00:00.000Z" }

### Creation examen sur un cours inexistant (404)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/exams
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

{ "courseId": 9999, "title": "Orphelin", "startsAt": "2026-09-10T08:00:00.000Z", "endsAt": "2026-09-10T10:00:00.000Z" }

### Suppression examen qui a des tentatives (409, RG-09)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/exams/3
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

# =====================================================================
#  Questions et resultats — perimetre P4
# =====================================================================

### Questions d'un examen, vue admin (is_correct visible, route protegee)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/exams/1/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### Questions sans token (401) — RG-07 : la faille serait ici
GET http://localhost:4000/api/exams/1/questions

### Creation question a un seul choix (400, RG-04)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/exams/1/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

{ "statement": "Un seul choix ?", "points": 2, "choices": [{ "label": "a", "isCorrect": true }] }

### Creation question a sept choix (400, RG-04)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/exams/1/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

{ "statement": "Sept choix ?", "points": 2, "choices": [{ "label": "a", "isCorrect": true }, { "label": "b" }, { "label": "c" }, { "label": "d" }, { "label": "e" }, { "label": "f" }, { "label": "g" }] }

### Creation question sans bonne reponse (400, RG-04)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/exams/1/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

{ "statement": "Aucune bonne reponse ?", "points": 2, "choices": [{ "label": "a" }, { "label": "b" }] }

### Creation question avec deux bonnes reponses (400, RG-04)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/exams/1/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

{ "statement": "Deux bonnes reponses ?", "points": 2, "choices": [{ "label": "a", "isCorrect": true }, { "label": "b", "isCorrect": true }] }

### Creation question avec un bareme a zero (400, RG-04)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/exams/1/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

{ "statement": "Bareme nul ?", "points": 0, "choices": [{ "label": "a", "isCorrect": true }, { "label": "b" }] }

### Creation question sur un examen deja passe (409, RG-08)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/exams/3/questions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

{ "statement": "Trop tard", "points": 2, "choices": [{ "label": "a", "isCorrect": true }, { "label": "b" }] }

### Suppression question d'un examen deja passe (409, RG-08)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/questions/11
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### Questions d'un examen inexistant (404)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/exams/9999/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### Resultats d'un examen (moyenne calculee en SQL)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/exams/3/results
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

# =====================================================================
#  Espace etudiant et notation — perimetre P5
#
#  Rejouer npm run db:reset avant cette section : elle cree une tentative,
#  et RG-02 interdit d'en creer une seconde.
# =====================================================================

### Login etudiant actif
# @name loginEtudiant
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "miora@examhub.local", "password": "Etudiant123!" }

### Examens disponibles (RG-03 fenetre ouverte, RG-02 pas deja passes)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/my/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{loginEtudiant.response.body.token}}

### Espace etudiant appele par un administrateur (403)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/my/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### Chargement d'un examen ouvert (200)
# RG-07 : verifier a l'oeil que la reponse ne contient AUCUN champ isCorrect.
GET http://localhost:4000/api/my/exams/1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginEtudiant.response.body.token}}

### Chargement d'un examen ferme (403, RG-03)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/my/exams/2
Authorization: Bearer {{loginEtudiant.response.body.token}}

### Chargement d'un examen inexistant (404)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/my/exams/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{loginEtudiant.response.body.token}}

### Soumission partielle (201, RG-05)
# Deux questions repondues sur cinq : les trois autres valent 0 point.
# La note attendue est calculee par le serveur, jamais envoyee par le client.
POST http://localhost:4000/api/my/exams/1/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginEtudiant.response.body.token}}

{ "answers": [ { "questionId": 1, "choiceId": 1 }, { "questionId": 2, "choiceId": 5 }, { "questionId": 3, "choiceId": null } ] }

### Deuxieme soumission du meme examen (409, RG-02)
# A rejouer immediatement apres la precedente : la base ne doit contenir
# qu'une seule tentative, verifiable avec la requete SQL du README.
POST http://localhost:4000/api/my/exams/1/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginEtudiant.response.body.token}}

{ "answers": [ { "questionId": 1, "choiceId": 1 } ] }

### Soumission avec un score injecte et des identifiants etrangers
# RG-06 : le champ "score" est ignore, le serveur recalcule tout.
# Le choiceId 8 appartient a une autre question, le questionId 4 a un autre
# examen : les deux sont neutralises, la question compte comme non repondue.
POST http://localhost:4000/api/my/exams/1/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginEtudiant.response.body.token}}

{ "score": 999, "answers": [ { "questionId": 1, "choiceId": 8 }, { "questionId": 4, "choiceId": 11 } ] }

### Soumission sur un examen ferme (403, RG-03)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/my/exams/2/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginEtudiant.response.body.token}}

{ "answers": [ { "questionId": 6, "choiceId": 17 } ] }

### Historique personnel (tri du plus recent au plus ancien, en SQL)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/my/results
Authorization: Bearer {{loginEtudiant.response.body.token}}

### Historique sans token (401)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/my/results

